# Rule Creation Guidelines

- **One purpose per rule** — focused, actionable, scoped.
- **Under 500 lines** — split large rules into composable files.
- **Reference over copy** — point to canonical files with `@filename` instead of stale snippets.
- **No redundancy** — don't duplicate linter config or obvious tool usage.

Start simple; add rules when the same mistake repeats twice.
